-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.2.0 (2026-10-02)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Kept languages are never removed, apt simulates the removal first
  * Dry run shows apt's real plan and the exclude file
  * Added pt_BR, pt-br, zh_CN, zh_TW and sr@latin codes, unknown codes are an error, English is always kept
  * Fixed bare --keep looping forever
  * No options keeps the language of /etc/default/locale and English, or prints the usage
  * Fixed the yad window and added a confirmation
  * Path excludes match whole locale names
  * Added Polish and pt_BR strings, LICENSE and install.sh
  * Restore brings back the packages the tool removed
  * Depends on sparky-remsu

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.1 (2026-10-02)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Fix parsing comma-separated --keep values

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.0 (2026-10-02)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Initial release
